# Bulky raw outputs of computations stay on disk only: a run writes them into a raw/ folder; the programs,
# their parameters and small result logs and summaries stay in git. The files below are older outputs of this kind
# (purged from the history on 2026-11-03; backup bundle in ../latex-git-backup-2026-11-03.bundle).
projects/*.submission/**/raw/
projects/*.submission/**/*.err
projects/*.submission/**/*.pid
